{"type":"standard","title":"Southwest Tanna language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Southwest Tanna language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q3504488","titles":{"canonical":"Southwest_Tanna_language","normalized":"Southwest Tanna language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Southwest Tanna language</span></span>"},"pageid":38528749,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1265920282","tid":"a7b2b040-c5b6-11ef-9082-263983fec73b","timestamp":"2024-12-29T07:29:36Z","description":"Austronesian language spoken in Vanuatu","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southwest_Tanna_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southwest_Tanna_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southwest_Tanna_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Southwest_Tanna_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southwest_Tanna_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Southwest_Tanna_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southwest_Tanna_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Southwest_Tanna_language"}},"extract":"Southwest Tanna is a dialect chain spoken on the southwestern coast of Tanna Island in Vanuatu. Lynch (1982) names three major dialects: Nivhaal in the north-west of the language area, Nivai in the south-west, and Nelpwaai in the north-east.","extract_html":"<p><b>Southwest Tanna</b> is a dialect chain spoken on the southwestern coast of Tanna Island in Vanuatu. Lynch (1982) names three major dialects: Nivhaal in the north-west of the language area, Nivai in the south-west, and Nelpwaai in the north-east.</p>"}